ve in environments, discarded data, environmental details, and archived communications. Nothing pauses to explain itself. Players piece together what happened, what\u2019s happening, and what it means. Understanding the world is optional\u2026 but ignorance is fatal.<br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>VISCERAL GORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impact is immediate and physical. Damage has weight, consequence, and permanence. Enemies break, deform, and react dynamically to force and weapon type. Combat is messy, desperate, and uncomfortable \u2014 every encounter leaves evidence behind. Violence isn\u2019t stylized spectacle; it\u2019s raw, tactile, and unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008240/extras/0ed5ae4824a8d50cda7bb37748698302.poster.avif?t=1772549171\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008240/extras/0ed5ae4824a8d50cda7bb37748698302.webm?t=1772549171\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Signal Decay Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008240/f368e8aa0dace6539a55979050c10985294fa09e/header.jpg?t=1772549171","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4008240/888656845/cb2c674d7b67d4cd9f13e1695119c7fd4d9abbbc/1771531106/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771532024","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4008240/888656845/cb2c674d7b67d4cd9f13e1695119c7fd4d9abbbc/1771531106/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771532024"